Package: spatialFDNN
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Functional Deep Neural Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ufuk", "Beyaztas", email = "ufuk.beyaztas@marmara.edu.tr",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5208-4950"))
Description: Prediction of a scalar response from functional and scalar
    predictors observed at spatial locations. The spatial autoregressive
    parameter is estimated by maximum likelihood in a linear working model
    built on functional principal component scores, the B-spline summaries of
    the predictors are filtered with the inverse of the spatial autoregressive
    operator, and a neural network with a sigmoid and a linear hidden layer is
    trained on the filtered summaries. The package also provides a residual
    correction for held-out sites with observed neighbors, perturbation
    contrasts of the fitted network, a bound on the sensitivity of the
    predictions to the spatial parameter, spatial weight matrices, and the
    data-generating designs of the simulation study.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: Matrix, splines, stats, utils
